{{ iceIntro | safe }}

<figure class="icereg-proof">
  <div class="icereg-bar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>REGISTRATION PROOF / FIVE PASSES</span>
    <span class="icereg-statuses">
      <span class="icereg-status-ready">READY</span>
      <span class="icereg-status-running">REGISTERING</span>
      <span class="icereg-status-done">REGISTERED</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <label class="icereg-control">
    <input class="icereg-toggle" type="checkbox" autocomplete="off" />
    <span class="icereg-switch" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="icereg-control-copy">
      <b class="icereg-control-run">ALIGN FIVE PASSES</b>
      <b class="icereg-control-reset">RESET PROOF</b>
      <small>Press once. Watch the work register.</small>
    </span>
  </label>

  <div class="icereg-stage" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="icereg-sheet">
      <p class="icereg-paper-meta">
        <span>OPTICAL PROOF / 005</span>
        <span>SAME SUBJECT / NEW ENERGY</span>
      </p>

      <span class="icereg-crop icereg-crop-nw"></span>
      <span class="icereg-crop icereg-crop-ne"></span>
      <span class="icereg-crop icereg-crop-sw"></span>
      <span class="icereg-crop icereg-crop-se"></span>

      <div class="icereg-fixed-proof">
        <span class="icereg-fixed-label">FIXED PROOF / SAME CUBE</span>
        <span class="icereg-cube"></span>
        <span class="icereg-puddle"></span>
      </div>

      <span class="icereg-plate icereg-pass-01">
        <span class="icereg-pass-label">PASS 01 / +2.1 J/g</span>
      </span>
      <span class="icereg-plate icereg-pass-02">
        <span class="icereg-pass-label">PASS 02 / +2.1 J/g</span>
      </span>
      <span class="icereg-plate icereg-pass-03">
        <span class="icereg-pass-label">PASS 03 / +2.1 J/g</span>
      </span>
      <span class="icereg-plate icereg-pass-04">
        <span class="icereg-pass-label">PASS 04 / +2.1 J/g</span>
      </span>
      <span class="icereg-plate icereg-pass-05">
        <span class="icereg-pass-label">PASS 05 / +2.1 J/g</span>
      </span>

      <span class="icereg-seal">
        <span>0&deg;C</span>
        <strong>PHASE CHANGE</strong>
      </span>
    </div>

    <p class="icereg-readout">
      <span>PASS ENERGY / +2.1 J/g &times; 5</span>
      <strong>&asymp;10.5 J/g ABSORBED</strong>
    </p>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="icereg-caption">
    Five cyan passes represent the roughly 10.5 J/g absorbed while one gram of
    ice warms from &minus;5&deg;C to 0&deg;C. The cube looks unchanged while
    every pass lands. Only the completed registration reveals the gold
    phase-change seal and puddle; fully melting that gram takes roughly
    334 J/g more.
    <strong>
      This is a visual analogy for accumulated work, not a literal picture of
      heat transfer or a literal printing process.
    </strong>
    <span class="icereg-static-note">
      Motion is switched off, so the fully registered proof is shown.
    </span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

